    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "And us. We're Apprentice, the app he built.",
      "say": "[deadpan] And us. We're Apprentice, the app he built.",
      "hl": "Apprentice"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "Gustaf Garnow, designer, Stockholm. He builds by talking to agents.",
      "hl": "talking to agents"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "This week: eight projects, a hundred and seventy-five instructions. On Wednesday the agents worked until thirteen past three.",
      "caption": "This week: 8 projects, 175 instructions. On Wednesday the agents worked until 03:13.",
      "hl": "03:13"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "A month later, he can't explain what he built. So he built us.",
      "hl": "can't explain|So he built us."
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "We remember how he built it, ask him until it sticks, and hand his taste to every agent he uses.",
      "hl": "remember|ask him until it sticks|every agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "The expert is him, today. The new hire is him, in a month.",
      "hl": "him, in a month"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "Next: the always-on apprentice, for every team.",
      "hl": "for every team"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "He would tell you this himself.",
      "caption": false
